{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（12日）中午12時59分，太子荔枝角道近塘尾道發生交通意外，一輛白色豐田私家車與一輛客貨車相撞。警方接報到場經調查後，懷疑私家車司機涉嫌藥後駕駛。經毒理測試後，涉事男司機對冰毒、可卡因及氯胺酮呈陽性反應，警方以「藥後駕駛」將他拘捕。現場可見，司機被黑布蒙頭，人員在緝毒犬協助下搜車。</p><figure><img alt=\"司機被黑布蒙頭，人員在緝毒犬協助下在場搜車。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260912/1175441372258242560573840.jpeg/YGSU9ug1TvQlELUhZHN1oiayMJ1r3L-ns5WAX7OVgF8\"/><figcaption>司機被黑布蒙頭，人員在緝毒犬協助下在場搜車。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"私家車司機正在場協助調查。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260912/1175436408744054784593684.jpeg/-G8_256WPABEez6uFuOltDX0_j6wT30C9ieGbvYnhm4\"/><figcaption>私家車司機正在場協助調查。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方派出緝毒犬到場搜索。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260912/1175434699024109568063198.jpeg/1SWvamUuz6x1rOrvzO4_XuF0pYMwQoINk7USW5O1Els\"/><figcaption>警方派出緝毒犬到場搜索。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涉事私家車司機被帶上警車。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260912/1175442311400656896379182.jpeg/swvPge1HqGNDieV-YFvvPswplfCoxemT4ZNeEcuTXhE\"/><figcaption>涉事私家車司機被帶上警車。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"私家車從後撞客貨VAN，揭私家車司機疑藥後駕駛在場協助調查。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260912/1175434701364662272568097.jpeg/804yu7JVBO3b7WGtV55o-7s72YhUqM7-BK7ylQSu8pU\"/><figcaption>私家車從後撞客貨VAN，揭私家車司機疑藥後駕駛在場協助調查。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"太子荔枝角道近塘尾道一輛家私家車及貨車相撞，揭私家車司機疑藥後駕駛在場協助調查。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260912/1175434703629717504207695.jpeg/hOVYjJ7Mvl2EjXG4ZJCN-VbBwc2xXZMkZh87Z2YfO2c\"/><figcaption>太子荔枝角道近塘尾道一輛家私家車及貨車相撞，揭私家車司機疑藥後駕駛在場協助調查。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方在場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260912/1175441478516740096871459.jpeg/_csMhrXo7HgtAA1HDZTWbNKud7EtrNyboUigvaFIoL0\"/><figcaption>警方在場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"人員在場調查。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260912/1175441868935139328807935.jpeg/LwPe28ZgDH1v__VctoqFipWhsaZ1W_KS3tZu697Wbus\"/><figcaption>人員在場調查。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方派出緝毒犬搜索。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260912/1175442461548351488037814.jpeg/IeXipMJy8Efu1OWSUrj7FSX1fHV_BB47tFQobrRUKG4\"/><figcaption>警方派出緝毒犬搜索。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一輛私家車追撞一輛客貨車，揭發私家車疑藥後駕駛。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260912/1175438550678900736369180.jpeg/pVmOEnjFmo4_CQCBq0hcnKFh7eqOXYT80BGhuPoRobg\"/><figcaption>一輛私家車追撞一輛客貨車，揭發私家車疑藥後駕駛。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方在場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260912/1175438547960860672817930.jpeg/T14bsk2bI3T6sydrDfNIG2SwVPS7ygurJx0G7w0dBu8\"/><figcaption>警方在場調查。（翁鈺輝攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"涉事私家車司機正協助調查。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260912/1175439053135286272978325.jpeg/XUZs5BGmwXuac3MnfJ4z9hQSG5KCNtsS0jp-39I6ft8\"/><figcaption>涉事私家車司機正協助調查。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-12T05:58:49.575659+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":426,"images":12,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}